WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.233 --> 00:00:01.768
Images from earlier today of

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.103
barricades being erected

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:03.903
near the courthouse

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:04.771
where the grand jury

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.139
investigation into the former

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:08.008
president is taking place.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.076
More security cameras are also going up.

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:11.344
And we mentioned earlier

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:12.479
the fears of violence

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:14.280
from his most fervid followers

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:14.981
after Trump

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:15.448
wrote on

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.550
social media to, quote, protest,

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.252
take our nation back.

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:20.487
There is also the question of

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:22.322
how do you protect a former president

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:23.656
during such an unprecedented

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.692
and historic moment and time?

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:26.126
I'm joined

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:28.094
now by our senior crime and justice

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:29.429
correspondent, Shimon Prokupecz.

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:30.563
Shimon, what more

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:31.931
can you tell us about the timing

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:33.600
regarding the potential indictment?

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.035
And how is law enforcement

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:39.439
preparing for such a potential moment?

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:40.306
Yeah, I mean, there's

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:41.641
so many different dynamics

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:42.842
at play here, Pam.

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:43.510
When you think about it,

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:44.677
you have a former president, a

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.012
never before

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:47.414
in the history of our country

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:49.616
have we seen a situation like this.

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:51.851
Then you have potential protesters.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:53.953
You have the fact that law enforcement

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:54.821
is thinking about

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:55.789
what happened

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:57.257
on January six

00:00:57.257 --> 00:01:00.093
and what they may have missed back then.

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:01.027
And so

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:02.495
all of that is factoring

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:03.363
into the decision

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:05.065
making that's going on here

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:06.332
from federal law enforcement

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:07.267
to the New York City

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:09.002
Police Department, state

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:09.302
and other

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.203
federal agencies

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:11.871
who have all been in meetings

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.473
for the last several days.

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:15.575
One of the things that certainly

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:18.144
is very concerning was the posting,

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:18.778
the social media

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:20.547
posting by the former president,

00:01:20.547 --> 00:01:22.682
sort of calling on his followers

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:24.851
to take to the streets to take action

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:26.886
that he was going to be arrested.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.455
Tomorrow, we're getting indications

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:29.222
that that is actually

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:31.224
absolutely not true, that

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:32.025
the soonest

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:32.725
or the earliest

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:33.927
that we could see the president

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:35.895
if he was to be indicted

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:37.130
and we don't know when that would be

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:38.498
or if that would even happen

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:40.233
would be next week.

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.434
That's what law enforcement

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:42.669
is working on

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:44.170
right now, that his initial court

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.005
appearance would be next week.

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:48.908
So everything and all of that is playing

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.143
into what law enforcement here

00:01:50.143 --> 00:01:50.810
is going to be doing

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.679
in terms of increasing security

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:53.947
around the courthouse,

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:55.281
bringing in barricades,

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:56.716
bringing in more cameras,

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:57.383
and, of course,

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:59.586
bringing in the former president

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:01.020
into the courthouse.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.288
That is the number one

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:03.823
priority for the Secret Service

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:05.825
to ensure his security.

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:07.727
And that in sort of his arrival here

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:08.761
at the courthouse,

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:10.130
which could happen next week now.

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:12.065
So a lot still at play

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:13.166
as law enforcement tries

00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:15.135
to figure out the logistics

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:16.236
of all of this

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:17.737
and protecting the former president.

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:18.271
And obviously,

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:19.772
anybody who comes out here

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:20.874
and the court staff

00:02:20.874 --> 00:02:22.308
and the people who live around here

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:23.843
and work around the park.

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:24.110
All right.

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:25.044
So stay with us, Shimon,

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:26.045
because I want to bring in CNN

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:26.946
senior law enforcement

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:28.381
analyst Andrew McCabe,

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:30.383
a former FBI deputy director.

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:30.984
So, Andrew,

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.318
as we mentioned, over the weekend,

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:34.287
the former president called for protests

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:36.055
ahead of a possible indictment.

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:38.324
What is law enforcement bracing for

00:02:38.525 --> 00:02:39.926
if he is charged?

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:43.163
Well, Pam, I think,

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:43.463
you know,

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:45.298
if you're a security professional,

00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:46.533
a law enforcement professional,

00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:48.001
you have to begin

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:48.801
by assuming

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:49.469
that the president

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:51.404
still has the same sort of sway

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:52.172
and influence

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:54.073
over his supporters that he did

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:56.009
leading into January 6th.

00:02:56.009 --> 00:02:58.378
So they are taking all the steps

00:02:58.378 --> 00:02:59.379
that many would argue

00:02:59.379 --> 00:03:00.346
should have been taken before

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:01.014
January six.

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:01.681
I'm sure they're looking

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:03.883
very closely at social media.

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:04.951
They're trying to understand

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:06.753
if there's chatter out there online

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:08.755
and those places where

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:09.722
the former president's

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:11.824
most extreme adherents go to

00:03:11.824 --> 00:03:13.092
to exchange messages

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:14.060
and things like that.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:14.827
I would expect

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:16.663
that my former colleagues at the FBI

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:18.064
are speaking to their sources

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:19.966
of information and informants

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:21.634
in those communities to tap

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:23.836
into what sort of interest there is.

00:03:23.836 --> 00:03:25.572
And in convening in New York

00:03:25.572 --> 00:03:28.775
or any other place around, a potential

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:30.410
arraignment and charges.

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:32.745
And New York is

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:34.747
relying on their deep experience

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:35.248
in crowd

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:36.916
control is no place in the country

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:39.252
that does it better than New York City.

00:03:39.252 --> 00:03:40.753
I'm confident that they'll be

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:41.754
they'll be well-prepared.

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:43.323
They'll take whatever steps are necessary

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:44.324
to avoid what we saw

00:03:44.324 --> 00:03:45.725
happen on January six.

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:46.893
Do you think, though, indeed,

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:48.761
that he still has the influence

00:03:48.761 --> 00:03:49.395
to mobilize

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:50.330
far right supporters

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.999
like he did on January six?

00:03:52.999 --> 00:03:55.501
I think you have to assume that he does.

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:56.236
I mean,

00:03:56.836 --> 00:03:57.170
you know,

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.606
this is a very different sort of event.

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:01.641
I mean, the lead up to January six,

00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:02.342
the president

00:04:02.342 --> 00:04:04.744
and his supporters had many days to talk

00:04:04.744 --> 00:04:06.312
about coming to D.C.

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:07.447
There was a date certain

00:04:07.447 --> 00:04:08.514
that they needed to be there.

00:04:08.514 --> 00:04:09.949
That all facilitates

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:11.851
organization and transportation

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:12.752
and funding for people

00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:14.020
who want to come and attend.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.122
And they also had the cover,

00:04:16.122 --> 00:04:19.359
if you will, of a legitimate permitted

00:04:19.926 --> 00:04:21.828
assembly at the Ellipse.

00:04:21.828 --> 00:04:22.795
So those are all things

00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:25.498
that don't really add into the mix here,

00:04:25.598 --> 00:04:27.166
which I think puts law enforcement

00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:28.201
and security professionals

00:04:28.201 --> 00:04:29.469
in a little better position.

00:04:29.469 --> 00:04:31.170
But they have to plan for the worst.

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:32.639
That's their job.

00:04:32.639 --> 00:04:34.140
There's so many questions.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:34.907
Shimon,

00:04:34.907 --> 00:04:36.542
that we're asking for the first time

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:39.012
because of the unprecedented nature

00:04:39.012 --> 00:04:39.779
at play here.

00:04:39.779 --> 00:04:40.680
If this happens,

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:42.949
is there any word in terms of logistics

00:04:42.949 --> 00:04:44.250
on how Donald Trump

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.351
would appear in the courtroom

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:48.121
if he is indicted?

00:04:48.254 --> 00:04:50.256
Everyone expects him to appear here

00:04:50.256 --> 00:04:51.824
like any other defendants. Right.

00:04:51.824 --> 00:04:53.192
So the Manhattan DA's office,

00:04:53.192 --> 00:04:55.228
when there's an indictment,

00:04:55.228 --> 00:04:57.730
they then notify the defense attorneys

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:58.765
for the

00:04:58.765 --> 00:05:00.333
for the defendant, for for the person

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:01.134
who is going to be arrested

00:05:01.134 --> 00:05:02.502
or that a person appears

00:05:02.502 --> 00:05:03.903
at the district attorney's office,

00:05:03.903 --> 00:05:05.672
which is just behind me, where they are

00:05:05.672 --> 00:05:07.974
processed, fingerprinted, photographed,

00:05:07.974 --> 00:05:09.042
and then they're brought over

00:05:09.042 --> 00:05:10.343
to the courthouse, usually

00:05:11.477 --> 00:05:12.879
the Manhattan DA's office.

00:05:12.879 --> 00:05:14.814
You know, they walk the defendant

00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:16.115
through the halls of the courthouse,

00:05:16.115 --> 00:05:17.050
into the courtroom

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:19.018
for all of us to see handcuffed.

00:05:19.018 --> 00:05:19.519
We don't think

00:05:19.519 --> 00:05:21.621
that's going to happen here.

00:05:21.621 --> 00:05:23.189
You know, for many reasons.

00:05:23.189 --> 00:05:24.490
But we certainly do expect

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:25.458
that he'll be here.

00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:26.192
But I do just want to know

00:05:26.192 --> 00:05:26.826
one thing, Pam,

00:05:26.826 --> 00:05:28.561
that in terms of social media postings

00:05:28.561 --> 00:05:29.395
and threats,

00:05:29.395 --> 00:05:30.063
I've actually spoke

00:05:30.063 --> 00:05:31.230
to a law enforcement official today

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:31.731
who said

00:05:31.731 --> 00:05:32.865
they're seeing actually that

00:05:32.865 --> 00:05:33.866
things are pretty quiet

00:05:33.866 --> 00:05:34.567
on social media

00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:36.302
and nothing like the run up

00:05:36.302 --> 00:05:38.071
on January six.

00:05:38.071 --> 00:05:39.405
They've been running down things.

00:05:39.405 --> 00:05:41.407
They've been sort of questioning people

00:05:41.407 --> 00:05:43.109
who are posting suspicious things.

00:05:43.109 --> 00:05:44.510
But so far from everything

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:45.511
that they're seeing,

00:05:45.511 --> 00:05:47.180
while there may be a lot of noise,

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.815
there's not a lot of concern for them

00:05:48.815 --> 00:05:49.415
right now.

00:05:49.415 --> 00:05:50.850
Biggest concern is getting the

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.852
the former president here safely.

00:05:52.852 --> 00:05:53.553
And that is something

00:05:53.553 --> 00:05:55.822
that they're certainly working on.

00:05:55.822 --> 00:05:58.191
All right, Jim Prokupecz, Andrew McCabe,

00:05:58.191 --> 00:05:59.859
thank you so much.

00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:01.094
Well, sometimes lost in the headlines

00:06:01.094 --> 00:06:01.828
about the president,

00:06:01.828 --> 00:06:03.363
the indictment or his party's

00:06:03.363 --> 00:06:04.497
reaction to all of this

00:06:04.497 --> 00:06:06.065
is the story of the woman

00:06:06.065 --> 00:06:08.668
at the center of this alleged cover up.

00:06:08.935 --> 00:06:09.769
Stephanie Clifford,

00:06:09.769 --> 00:06:12.105
who goes by the name Stormy Daniels.

00:06:12.438 --> 00:06:15.041
CNN's Tom Foreman has all those details.

00:06:17.043 --> 00:06:18.811
He had a hit television show.

00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:20.880
She was in adult films.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:21.748
He was 60.

00:06:21.748 --> 00:06:23.616
She was 27

00:06:23.616 --> 00:06:25.051
when they met at a golf tournament

00:06:25.051 --> 00:06:26.519
in 2006,

00:06:26.519 --> 00:06:28.421
where Stormy Daniels says Donald Trump

00:06:28.421 --> 00:06:30.056
shared photos of his wife,

00:06:30.056 --> 00:06:31.557
his new baby boy.

00:06:31.557 --> 00:06:33.393
And you had sex with him? Yes.

00:06:33.393 --> 00:06:36.095
And Trump has denied it ever since.

00:06:36.195 --> 00:06:38.297
And to be bringing up that kind of crap

00:06:38.297 --> 00:06:39.899
and to be bringing up witch

00:06:39.899 --> 00:06:40.833
hunt all the time,

00:06:40.833 --> 00:06:42.502
that's all you want to talk about.

00:06:42.502 --> 00:06:43.936
Born in Louisiana,

00:06:43.936 --> 00:06:44.904
Stephanie Clifford

00:06:44.904 --> 00:06:46.339
got into adult entertainment

00:06:46.339 --> 00:06:48.908
in her teens, taking the name Stormy.

00:06:49.142 --> 00:06:49.942
By her account,

00:06:49.942 --> 00:06:51.511
she thought Trump might help her

00:06:51.511 --> 00:06:52.979
get into TV.

00:06:52.979 --> 00:06:55.381
Instead, her allegations of an affair

00:06:55.415 --> 00:06:58.217
took over the headlines, a key claim

00:06:58.384 --> 00:06:59.752
as Trump's 2016

00:06:59.752 --> 00:07:01.521
campaign came to the wire.

00:07:01.521 --> 00:07:05.057
She says she was paid $100,000

00:07:05.224 --> 00:07:07.160
to keep quiet about him.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.795
He denied any knowledge of

00:07:08.795 --> 00:07:10.863
that in the spring of 2018.

00:07:12.064 --> 00:07:12.932
Did you

00:07:17.537 --> 00:07:19.238
but that same summer,

00:07:19.238 --> 00:07:21.140
did you know about the payments?

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:22.341
Later on, I knew.

00:07:22.341 --> 00:07:24.911
Her story has seemed at times confusing.

00:07:25.077 --> 00:07:26.245
For example, at one point

00:07:26.245 --> 00:07:27.480
she signed statements

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:30.183
denying any affair took place

00:07:30.416 --> 00:07:33.252
if it was untruthful.

00:07:33.252 --> 00:07:34.921
Why did you sign it?

00:07:34.921 --> 00:07:36.222
Because they made

00:07:36.222 --> 00:07:37.757
it sound like I had no choice.

00:07:37.757 --> 00:07:37.924
I mean,

00:07:37.924 --> 00:07:39.459
no one was putting a gun to your head.

00:07:39.459 --> 00:07:41.260
Not physical violence now.

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:42.361
You thought that there would be

00:07:42.361 --> 00:07:43.830
some sort of legal repercussion

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:44.764
if you didn't sign that?

00:07:44.764 --> 00:07:45.465
As a matter of fact,

00:07:45.465 --> 00:07:47.300
the exact sentence used was

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.035
They can make your life

00:07:49.035 --> 00:07:50.870
hell in many different ways.

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:52.672
Further complicating questions

00:07:52.672 --> 00:07:54.273
now at the Center of the legal case

00:07:54.273 --> 00:07:55.308
against Trump,

00:07:55.308 --> 00:07:56.809
did the alleged payoff

00:07:56.809 --> 00:07:58.878
come from campaign funds,

00:07:58.878 --> 00:08:01.013
and was that a violation of campaign

00:08:01.013 --> 00:08:02.582
finance laws?

00:08:02.582 --> 00:08:04.250
Former Trump lawyer Michael Cohen,

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.318
who went to prison over

00:08:05.318 --> 00:08:05.852
that alleged

00:08:05.852 --> 00:08:07.854
hush money, says yes

00:08:07.854 --> 00:08:09.655
and that Trump knew about it.

00:08:09.655 --> 00:08:10.690
But others in Trump's

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.658
orbit say no way

00:08:12.658 --> 00:08:14.560
that money was not campaign money.

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:15.394
Sorry.

00:08:15.394 --> 00:08:17.263
As for the former president,

00:08:17.263 --> 00:08:18.164
just days ago,

00:08:18.164 --> 00:08:19.999
he leveled an insult at Daniels

00:08:19.999 --> 00:08:22.001
as he insisted once again.

00:08:22.001 --> 00:08:24.337
I did nothing wrong in the horse

00:08:24.337 --> 00:08:25.505
face case.

00:08:25.505 --> 00:08:27.406
Never had an affair with her.

00:08:27.406 --> 00:08:29.008
Witch hunt.

00:08:29.008 --> 00:08:31.477
This story has been unwinding for years

00:08:31.477 --> 00:08:32.011
and it is now

00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:34.113
full of many twists and turns.

00:08:34.413 --> 00:08:36.449
But it may finally now be time for

00:08:36.449 --> 00:08:38.651
a court to sort it all out.

